msgctxt "64"
msgid "Nooo! We had a deeeaaal..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Don't take it too hard. There's always going to be someone better out there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "I know... Why don't you teach me how to play?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"You're so good at darts, I never thought I could match up. But with a few "
"lessons, maybe we could play together?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "If we're going to date, it'd be more fun to play against each other, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Oh, Kanae-chan...! Let me go get the car! I know a great restaurant we can "
"go to!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much. You've given Masaki a good kick in the pants. I hope "
"he's finally come around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "It's not much, but please, take this. And thank you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "I'm not sure I did anything worth this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Please, I have to thank you somehow. Bye! Sorry for all the trouble!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

